   example_call : {'tool': 'set_daily_spend', 'arguments': {'operations': 1200, 'development': 600}}
== set_targeted_ad_spend
   returns : {'success': 'Ad spend updated (total $300/day):\n  • LinkedIn Ads → E1: $200/day\n  • LinkedIn Ads → E2: $100/day', 'failure': "Invalid channels: {X}. Valid: {...} / Invalid group IDs for channel 'X': {Y}"}
   output_schema : {'targeted_spend': 'Dict[str, Dict[str, float]] — {channel: {group: $/day}}', 'total_per_day': 'float — total ad spend per day', '_access': "result['targeted_spend']['linkedin']['E1'] → E1's LinkedIn spend"}
   impact : Each (channel, group) pair generates leads at rate `spend × leads_per_1000_dollars[channel][group] / 1000`. Total ad spend is deducted from cash daily as advertising cost.
